r Yadkin County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 it hit 50% of normal, and November to December came in at 44%. This year so far on the middle, March to April 2026 sits at 43% and June to July 2026 at 84%.</p>"}
